<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 29/30.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 29/30.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, April 30 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   30.04.97	  29.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5036	    6.4932</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3095	    2.3109</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5072	    4.5082</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1546	    3.1557</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5095	    0.5135</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7678	    0.7693</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2888	    0.2889</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8522	    6.8505</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6965	    0.6965</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2646	    1.2653</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
